%% VoxFlow — tool approval boundary (public contract)
flowchart TD
    Speech[Caller speech<br/>untrusted] --> Intent[Deterministic intent + argument extraction]
    Intent --> Schema{Schema valid?}
    Schema -- no --> Reject[Reject and re-ask]
    Schema -- yes --> Identity{Identity bound to account?}
    Identity -- no --> Refuse[Refuse / escalate]
    Identity -- yes --> Kind{Tool class}

    Kind -- read --> Execute[Execute]
    Kind -- reversible write --> Confirm{Explicit confirmation<br/>args hash matches?}
    Kind -- high-impact write --> Pin{PIN bound to same account?}
    Kind -- prohibited --> Block[Block and log]

    Pin -- no --> Refuse
    Pin -- yes --> Confirm
    Confirm -- no --> Cancel[Cancel, nothing written]
    Confirm -- yes --> Idem{Idempotency key seen?}
    Idem -- yes --> Replay[Return cached result<br/>no second write]
    Idem -- no --> Execute

    Execute --> Validate{Result schema valid?}
    Validate -- no --> Escalate[Escalate, never speak data]
    Validate -- yes --> Speak[Speak only allow-listed facts]
